{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线第一下落在左上方高亮的薄荷绿色大标题“舒舒服服地待在这份亲近里”，随后自然扫到下方同样醒目的灰白色大字“有多喜欢这样”。主入口明确，右上角目录和下半部分音符动画不抢主视线。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"此刻正安稳、舒服地待在一份亲近之中。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、喜欢、享受。\",\n  \"missed\": \"说完重要的话后仍然发怔，偶尔急切地说几句又沉默下去；声音渐远，思绪断续破碎。这些具体的心理和行为细节需要看正文才能获得。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"小字连续堆叠、要在多条之间挑；正文细节需要额外扫读，但不影响大标题传达核心。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 4\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2d28280b-9d5c-415d-870b-422fac24808d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T021002064201Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.235, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:10:29.302901+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "90b48e914c51365eee515ded68ce42f525cdc342f442cbbd95404dc5a1dc8df8", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f45828